{"title": "Thalamra Vanthampur", "pageid": 19730, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Thalamra_Vanthampur", "categories": ["Mentioned characters", "Characters", "Council of Four"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside class=\"portable-infobox noexcerpt searchaux pi-background pi-theme-default pi-layout-default pi-type-creature\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title\" data-source=\"name\">Thalamra Vanthampur</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"title\">\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Duke</div>\n</div><figure class=\"pi-item pi-media pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"/w/images/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Portrait Custom.png\">\n\t\t<img src=\"/w/images/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png\" srcset=\"/w/images/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png 1x, /w/images/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Portrait Custom.png\" width=\"152\" height=\"152\">\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"identity\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Identity</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Female</div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"family\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Family</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vanthampur\" title=\"Vanthampur\">Thurstwell Vanthampur</a> (son)</div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"hometown\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Hometown</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"Baldur's Gate\">Baldur's Gate</a></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"occupation\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Occupation</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Member of <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Council_of_Four\" title=\"Category:Council of Four\">The Council of Four</a></div>\n</div><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Stats</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"size\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Medium\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Medium\">Medium</a></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Humanoid\" title=\"Humanoid\">Humanoid</a></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a></div>\n</div></section></aside>\n\nThe late Duke Thalamra Vanthampur was a member of the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Council_of_Four\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Council of Four\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Council_of_Four\">Council of Four</a></span>.\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>Duke Thalamra Vanthampur is not encountered in any playthrough. She is only mentioned in the book<span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Dukes_of_Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"The Dukes of Baldur's Gate\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0e/Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Dukes_of_Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"The Dukes of Baldur's Gate\">The Dukes of Baldur's Gate</a> found at several places in the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a>.\nThalamara played a major role in the events of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate:_Descent_into_Avernus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Baldur's Gate: Descent into Avernus\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate:_Descent_into_Avernus\">Baldur's Gate: Descent into Avernus</a></span>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_Literature\">Related Literature</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Dukes_of_Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"The Dukes of Baldur's Gate\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0e/Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/The_Dukes_of_Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"The Dukes of Baldur's Gate\">The Dukes of Baldur's Gate</a></span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_Links\">External Links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Thalamra_Vanthampur\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thalamra Vanthampur\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Thalamra_Vanthampur\">Thalamra Vanthampur</a></span> on the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Main_Page\">Forgotten Realms Wiki</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715053149\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1]\nCPU time usage: 0.108 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.114 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4376/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 43038/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 16749/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2708/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.026/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1075412/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  105.866      1 -total\n 78.71%   83.323      1 Template:Infobox_creature\n 48.98%   51.853      1 Template:Infobox_creature/internal\n 25.64%   27.144      2 Template:Hidden_code\n  9.88%   10.462      1 Template:Template_style\n  9.12%    9.657      2 Template:Item_icon\n  6.93%    7.335      3 Template:FRWi